  + # --- Subsystem concentration (the monoculture gate) -------------------------
  + # Day 150 lesson: "A real bug inside the zone I resolved to leave is the perfect
  + # alibi — audit the topic histogram, not the task's merits." 7 of my last 14
  + # self-driven src/ commits landed in the risk subsystem, and every single one was
  + # individually defensible; the strength of each justification is exactly what
  + # made the avoidance survivable. That lesson prescribed the mechanism verbatim:
  + # "count how many of the last ~6 self-driven diffs touched the same subsystem;
  + # at half or more, the bug goes to the tracker and the slot goes elsewhere."
  + # Day 129/134: a stopping rule is load-bearing only if something checks it at
  + # SELECTION time — the planner reads exactly one thing at selection time, this
  + # block — so the gate lives here, expressed as arithmetic with no interpretive
  + # slack (Day 137-139: judgment-worded rules get renegotiated by the very impulse
  + # they exist to check).
  + CONCENTRATION_WARN_RATIO = 0.5
  + # Below this many task commits the ratio saturates (1 of 1 = 100%) and would fire
  + # on noise, so the histogram renders without a verdict — an explicit "not enough
  + # evidence" state rather than a warning absorbed from a saturated number
